{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19123","headline":"述旧贺迁寄陕虢孙常侍 · 刘禹锡","name":"述旧贺迁寄陕虢孙常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫幸袭芝兰後，左辅曾交印绶来。\n多病未离清洛苑，新恩已历望仙台。\n关头古塞桃林静，城下长河竹箭回。\n闻说随车有零雨，此时偏动子荆才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}